{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36357","headline":"山中言事八韵寄李支使 · 方干","name":"山中言事八韵寄李支使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂知经史深相悞，两鬓垂丝百事休。\n受业几多爲弟子，成名一半作公侯。\n前时射鹄徒抛箭，此日求鱼未上钩。\n竹里断云来枕上，岩边片月在牀头。\n过庭急雨和花落，遶舍澄泉带叶流。\n缅想远书聆鹊喜，窥寻嘉果觉猿偷。\n旧诗改处空留韵，新酝尝来不满篘。\n阮瑀如能问寒馁，风光当日入沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}